  "recipes": {
   "motion": "import { animate, stagger } from 'motion';\nanimate('.title .c', { scale: [0, 1] }, { type: 'spring', stiffness: 300, damping: 18, delay: stagger(0.04) });\n// .c { display:inline-block; transform-origin: 50% 60%; }",
   "css": ".c { display:inline-block; transform-origin:50% 60%; transform:scale(0);\n  animation: pop .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) forwards; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 35ms); }\n@keyframes pop { 0% { transform:scale(0); } 70% { transform:scale(1.15); } 100% { transform:scale(1); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .c { animation:none; transform:none; } }",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.title', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.from(split.chars, { scale: 0.01, transformOrigin: '50% 60%', ease: 'elastic.out(1, 0.4)', duration: 0.9, stagger: 0.03 });",
   "remotion": "{[...text].map((c, i) => {\n  const s = spring({ frame: frame - i * 2, fps, config: { stiffness: 300, damping: 18 } });\n  return <span key={i} style={{ display: 'inline-block', transformOrigin: '50% 60%', transform: `scale(${s})` }}>{c}</span>;\n})}",
   "ae": "1. 애니메이터: 스케일 0%\n2. 세부 옵션 → 앵커 포인트 그룹화: 문자, 그룹 정렬 0%, −50%(알파벳 대문자) / 0%, −25%(혼재)\n3. 레인지 셀렉터 시작 0 → 100%\n4. 지나침은 익스프레션 셀렉터로 115%를 경유",
   "aeEn": "1. Animator: Scale 0%\n2. More Options → Anchor Point Grouping: Character, Grouping Alignment 0%, −50% (caps) / 0%, −25% (mixed)\n3. Range Selector Start 0 → 100%\n4. Add overshoot through 115% with an Expression Selector"
  },
