  "descriptionEn": "Letters packed so tightly they overlap fade in while the tracking opens out to its natural spacing.",
  "focus": "자간 −0.5em(겹침) → 0. 점선이 문자열 폭이며 퍼짐에 맞춰 바깥으로 열린다. 불투명도와 동시에 움직이므로 겹친 덩어리가 「풀리는」 것처럼 보인다.",
  "focusEn": "Tracking −0.5em (overlap) → 0. The dashed lines mark the string’s width opening out. Combined with the fade, the clump appears to loosen.",
  "caution": "letter-spacing 애니메이션은 매 프레임 레이아웃을 재계산한다. 짧은 제목으로 한정하거나 글자별 translateX로 대용한다.",
  "cautionEn": "Animating letter-spacing triggers layout every frame — limit it to short headings or emulate with per-character translateX.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "letter-spacing −0.5em → 0 / opacity 0 → 1 / 0.7s / cubic-bezier(.215,.61,.355,1)",
  "recipeEn": "letter-spacing −0.5em → 0 / opacity 0 → 1 / 0.7s / cubic-bezier(.215,.61,.355,1)",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "시간·상태 변화",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
