  "recipes": {
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.title', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.to(split.chars, { x: () => gsap.utils.random(-300, 300), y: () => gsap.utils.random(-200, 200),\n  rotation: () => gsap.utils.random(-180, 180), opacity: 0, duration: 0.8, ease: 'power3.out',\n  stagger: { each: 0.01, from: 'center' }, onComplete: () => split.revert() });",
   "waapi": "chars.forEach((c, i) => {\n  const r = k => Math.sin((i + 1) * 127.1 * k) * 0.5 + 0.5; // 시드 포함\n  c.animate([{ transform: 'none', opacity: 1 },\n    { transform: `translate(${r(1) * 600 - 300}px, ${r(2) * 400 - 200}px) rotate(${r(3) * 360 - 180}deg)`, opacity: 0 }],\n    { duration: 800, delay: Math.abs(i - (chars.length - 1) / 2) * 10, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.215,.61,.355,1)', fill: 'forwards' });\n});",
   "ae": "1. 애니메이터: 위치 (500, 500)·회전 180°·불투명도 0%\n2. 레인지 셀렉터 삭제 → 표현식 셀렉터\n3. 양: seedRandom(textIndex, true); random(-100, 100)\n4. 「최대」 슬라이더로 양 전체를 키프레임(0 → 100)",
   "aeEn": "1. Animator: Position (500, 500), Rotation 180°, Opacity 0%\n2. Delete Range Selector → Expression Selector\n3. Amount: seedRandom(textIndex, true); random(-100, 100)\n4. Keyframe an overall “Max” slider 0 → 100"
  },
