  "recipes": {
   "css": ".badge { display:inline-block; transform-origin:50% 100%;\n  animation: hop 2.8s infinite; }\n@keyframes hop {\n  0%, 28.6%, 100% { transform: none; }\n  8.6%  { transform: translateY(-30%); animation-timing-function: ease-in; }\n  15.7% { transform: scale(1.06, .9); animation-timing-function: ease-out; }\n  21.4% { transform: translateY(-12%); animation-timing-function: ease-in; }\n  25.7% { transform: scale(1.04, .94); }\n}  /* 0.8s 움직이고 2s 쉼 = 주기 2.8s */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .badge { animation:none; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.set('.badge', { transformOrigin: '50% 100%' });\ngsap.timeline({ repeat: 3, repeatDelay: 2 })\n  .to('.badge', { yPercent: -30, duration: .24, ease: 'power2.out' })\n  .to('.badge', { yPercent: 0, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.in' })\n  .to('.badge', { scaleY: .9, scaleX: 1.06, duration: .05, yoyo: true, repeat: 1 })\n  .to('.badge', { yPercent: -12, duration: .16, ease: 'power2.out' })\n  .to('.badge', { yPercent: 0, duration: .12, ease: 'power2.in' })\n  .to('.badge', { scaleY: .94, scaleX: 1.04, duration: .04, yoyo: true, repeat: 1 });",
   "ae": "1. 앵커 포인트를 글자 아래 끝으로\n2. 위치 Y: 0 → -30% → 0 → -12% → 0(24프레임), 상승은 이즈아웃, 낙하는 이즈인\n3. 착지 프레임에서 스케일 [106, 90] → [100, 100](2프레임)\n4. 60프레임 쉬고 나서 루프(loopOut(\"cycle\")）",
   "aeEn": "1. Move the anchor point to the bottom of the text\n2. Position Y: 0 → −30% → 0 → −12% → 0 over 24 frames; ease-out going up, ease-in coming down\n3. On landing frames Scale [106, 90] → [100, 100] (2 frames)\n4. Rest 60 frames, then loopOut(\"cycle\")"
  },
