  "recipes": {
   "css": ".neon { color: #fff4fb;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 4px #fff, 0 0 11px #ff725e, 0 0 19px #ff725e, 0 0 40px #ff725e;\n  animation: flicker .9s linear both; }\n@keyframes flicker {\n  0%, 18%, 22%, 55%, 62%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  20% { opacity: .2; text-shadow: none; }\n  58% { opacity: .5; text-shadow: none; }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .neon { animation: none; } }",
   "waapi": "// 글자마다 조금씩 다른 불규칙한 키\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.neon span').forEach((el, i) => el.animate(\n  [{ opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1, offset: .1 }, { opacity: .2, offset: .18 + (i % 3) * .04 }, { opacity: 1, offset: .3 }, { opacity: .4, offset: .55 }, { opacity: 1 }],\n  { duration: 900, delay: 350 + i * 80, easing: 'steps(1, end)', fill: 'backwards' }));",
   "ae": "1. 텍스트 레이어 → 애니메이터 추가: 불투명도 0%\n2. 셀렉터 추가 → 위글리, 위글 수/초 15~25, 상관 0%\n3. 위글리의 「양」을 0~0.5초로 100% → 0%(이후는 점등)\n4. 이펙트 → 글로우(반지름 10~40, 강도 1~2)를 2회 겹친다",
   "aeEn": "1. Text layer → Animate: Opacity 0%\n2. Add Selector → Wiggly, Wiggles/Second 15–25, Correlation 0%\n3. Keyframe the Wiggly selector Amount 100% → 0% over the first 0.5 s\n4. Effect → Glow (radius 10–40, intensity 1–2), applied twice"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion",
   "https://helpx.adobe.com/after-effects/using/animating-text.html"
  ],
