   "css": ".rack .far, .rack .near { transition: filter 1.2s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1), opacity 1.2s; }\n.rack .near { filter: blur(8px); opacity: .7; }\n.rack.is-near .far { filter: blur(8px); opacity: .6; }\n.rack.is-near .near { filter: none; opacity: 1; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .rack * { transition: none; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline({ repeat: -1, repeatDelay: 1.3, yoyo: true })\n  .to('.rack .far',  { filter: 'blur(8px)', opacity: .6, duration: 1.2, ease: 'power2.inOut' }, 1.3)\n  .fromTo('.rack .near', { filter: 'blur(8px)' }, { filter: 'blur(0px)', duration: 1.2, ease: 'power2.inOut' }, 1.3);",
   "ae": "1. 두 텍스트 레이어를 3D로 하고 Z 위치를 띄운다(예: 뒤 800, 앞 200)\n2. 카메라 레이어 → 피사계 심도 켬, 조리개 크게\n3. 포커스 거리를 뒤 Z → 앞 Z로 0.8~1.5초에 키프레임(이지이즈)\n4. 전후로 1초 이상 멈춘다",
   "aeEn": "1. Make both text layers 3D and separate them in Z (e.g. far 800, near 200)\n2. Camera layer → Depth of Field on, wide aperture\n3. Keyframe Focus Distance from the far Z to the near Z over 0.8–1.5 s (Easy Ease)\n4. Hold at least a second on each side"
