  "recipes": {
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"87\">\n  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#232d42\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n  <circle class=\"bar\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"10\"\n    pathLength=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"100\" stroke-dashoffset=\"100\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(-90 60 60)\"/>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"pct\">0%</text>\n</svg>",
   "css": "@property --p { syntax: '<integer>'; initial-value: 0; inherits: true; }\n.ring { --p: 87; animation: fill 1.6s cubic-bezier(.5,1,.89,1) both; }   /* ≈ power2.out */\n.ring .bar { stroke-dashoffset: calc(100 - var(--p)); }\n.ring .pct::before { counter-reset: p var(--p); content: counter(p) \"%\"; }\n@keyframes fill { from { --p: 0; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ring { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "const o = { p: 0 };\ngsap.to(o, { p: 87, duration: 1.6, ease: 'power2.out', onUpdate() {\n  bar.style.strokeDashoffset = 100 - o.p; pct.textContent = Math.round(o.p) + '%';\n  svg.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', Math.round(o.p)); } });",
   "remotion": "const p = interpolate(frame, [0, 48], [0, 87], { easing: Easing.out(Easing.quad), extrapolateRight: 'clamp' });\nreturn (<svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\"><circle cx={60} cy={60} r={50} pathLength={100} strokeDasharray={100}\n  strokeDashoffset={100 - p} fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth={10} transform=\"rotate(-90 60 60)\" />\n  <text x={60} y={68} textAnchor=\"middle\">{Math.round(p)}%</text></svg>);",
   "ae": "1. 타원 셰이프(채우기 없음·선만) → 패스 트리밍: 끝 0 → 87%(1.6초·이즈아웃)\n2. 텍스트의 소스 텍스트에: Math.round(thisComp.layer(\"Ring\").content(\"Trim Paths 1\").end) + \"%\"\n3. 선 끝을 원형으로",
   "aeEn": "1. Ellipse shape (stroke only) → Trim Paths: End 0 → 87% (1.6 s, ease out)\n2. Text Source Text: Math.round(thisComp.layer(\"Ring\").content(\"Trim Paths 1\").end) + \"%\"\n3. Set Line Cap to Round"
  },
