   "css": ".banner { transform-origin: left; animation: wipe .27s cubic-bezier(.33,1,.68,1) both, flash .75s steps(1) .27s 1; }\n@keyframes wipe { from { transform: scaleX(0); } }\n@keyframes flash { 0%, 33%, 67% { background: #fff; } 17%, 50%, 83% { background: var(--red); } }\n.banner span { animation: slam .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .47s both; }\n@keyframes slam { from { transform: translateX(140px) skewX(17deg); opacity: 0; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .banner, .banner span { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .from('.banner', { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: 'left', duration: 8 / 30, ease: 'power3.out' })\n  .to('.banner', { backgroundColor: '#fff', duration: .125, ease: 'steps(1)', repeat: 5, yoyo: true })\n  .from('.banner span', { x: 140, skewX: 17, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .2, ease: 'expo.out' }, 8 / 30 + 6 / 30);",
   "ae": "1. 띠 셰이프: 스케일 X 0 → 100%를 8컷(왼쪽 끝 앵커)\n2. 채우기 색을 정지 키로 빨강/흰색 교대 4컷마다 ×3\n3. 텍스트를 6컷 지연으로 오른쪽에서 슬라이드+왜곡(모션 블러)\n4. 이후는 정지",
   "aeEn": "1. Banner shape: Scale X 0 → 100% over 8 frames (left anchor)\n2. Hold-key fill colour red/white every 4 frames × 3\n3. Text slides in from the right 6 frames later with skew + motion blur\n4. Then static"
