  "recipes": {
   "css": ".telop { position: relative; padding: .2em .6em; }\n.telop::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; background: var(--plate);\n  transform-origin: left; animation: plate .23s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }\n.telop span { display: inline-block; animation: in .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .1s both; }\n@keyframes plate { from { transform: scaleX(0); } }\n@keyframes in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-14px); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .telop::before, .telop span { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .from('.plate', { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: 'left', duration: 7 / 30, ease: 'expo.out' })\n  .from('.telop span', { x: -14, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .3, ease: 'expo.out' }, 3 / 30);\n// 퇴장: 글자 → 띠(transformOrigin: 'right'）",
   "ae": "1. 셰이프 레이어로 띠를 만들고 텍스트를 띠의 자식으로\n2. 띠의 스케일 X 0 → 100%(앵커 왼쪽 끝)를 7컷\n3. 텍스트의 불투명도·위치를 3컷 지연으로\n4. 퇴장은 키를 역순으로 복사",
   "aeEn": "1. Shape-layer plate; parent the text to it\n2. Plate Scale X 0 → 100% (left anchor) over 7 frames\n3. Text opacity/position 3 frames later\n4. Copy keys in reverse for the exit"
  },
