  descEn: 'When the first character moves, the rest chase it as if linked by springs, each lagging slightly behind, whipping around before falling back in line.',
  focus: '움직이는 것은 선두 1글자(강조색)뿐. 두 번째 글자부터는 「앞 글자의 위치 + 본래 자폭」을 스프링으로 따르므로, 늦음이 뒤로 쌓여 꼬리처럼 휘어진다. 글자 방향도 이어진 기울기에 맞춰 회전한다.',
  focusEn: 'Only the lead character (accent) is animated. Every other character springs toward “previous character + its advance width”, so the lag accumulates down the line and the word whips like a tail; each glyph also rotates to follow the chain’s slope.',
