  cautionEn: 'Lag and overshoot accumulate down the chain; with damping 0.75 a long string’s tail goes wild (the demo uses 0.6). Break the chain per line or per word, or damp harder. If it follows the cursor, disable following under reduced motion and lay the text out normally.',
